  Slug: antimagic-plating
  DisplayName: Antimagic Plating
  IconPath: icons/magic/light/beam-impact-deflect-teal.webp
  Description: Whether you used some clever adaptation of the magic-negating skymetal
    known as noqual or created magical protections of your own design, you've strengthened
    your armor against magic. While wearing the armor, you gain a +1 circumstance
    bonus to all saving throws against spells and to AC against spells. Against spells
    that target the armor directly, you instead gain a +4 circumstance bonus to all
    saving throws and to AC.
